    "View.lean": "The component for this op's fact. It reads only its own fact.",
    "Commands.lean": "Intents and responders, in the deepest folder that contains every op they write or read.",
    "Screen.lean": "Components that compose several ops, in the deepest folder that contains all of them.",
    "Proofs.lean": "Laws, in the deepest folder that contains every op they mention.",
    "Tests.lean": "Tests of the ops in this folder.",
